Module 1 – User Interface

This is what the user interacts with.

Components
10–15 inch Touch Display (or a normal HDMI monitor + touchscreen)
QR Code sticker (or QR display)
Status LEDs
Speaker/Buzzer
Purpose
Show welcome screen
Display QR code
Show detected waste
Show coins
Show "Accepted" or "Rejected"


Module 2 – Authentication

The machine itself doesn't need to authenticate.

The app scans the QR.

ESP32 receives

User ID
Machine ID
Authentication Success

Then

ESP32 unlocks the intake door.

Module 3 – Intake Door

This is one of the most important parts.

Components
Servo Motor (MG996R) or DC Gear Motor
Door Lock/Latch
Limit Switches (Door Open/Closed detection)
Flow
User presses Start

↓

Door unlocks

↓

Door opens

↓

User inserts waste

↓

Door closes automatically


